Epi Info 7 reference sources
============================

The files under this directory are verbatim, unmodified copies of files from
the Epi Info 7 Community Edition source repository:

    Repository : https://github.com/Epi-Info/Epi-Info-Community-Edition
    Commit     : 4cd353c62c40b78d9d1f013b0f5a2bb685a5fca6
    Licence    : Apache License, Version 2.0 (license.md in that repository;
                 see docs/spikes/d2-epi-info-licence.md, decision D2)
    Copyright  : Centers for Disease Control and Prevention

They are kept here as *reference material only*: the v1.1 command register
(crates/epiora-lang/register.json) is checked against them by
scripts/legacy/register-check.mjs, and later tasks author Epiora's own
expression and check-code grammars against them (spec §5.2, §4.4). No Epi
Info code is compiled into Epiora; "Epi Info" is a trademark of the CDC and
is used descriptively only.

Paths are preserved relative to the upstream repository root:

    Epi.Core.Interpreter/grammar/EpiInfo.Analysis.Grammar.grm
        GOLD-parser grammar for Classic Analysis (.pgm) commands.
    Epi.Core.EnterInterpreter/grammar/EpiInfo.Enter.Grammar.grm
        GOLD-parser grammar for Enter check code.
    Epi.Core.Interpreter/Rules/EpiFunctions.cs
        Classic Analysis function-name dispatch table.
    Epi.Core.EnterInterpreter/Rules/EpiFunctions.cs
        Enter check-code function-name dispatch table.
    Epi.Core/Constants/MetaFieldType.cs
        MakeView field-type enumeration.
